&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior People Operations Specialist, you will play a key role in delivering a seamless and positive employee experience throughout the entire employee lifecycle. You will own and continuously improve core People Operations processes, ensuring compliance, operational excellence and scalable service delivery from onboarding through offboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
