&lt;li&gt;Support managers and employees with operational HR questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issue employment and reference letters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain employee guides and process documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardize employee lifecycle processes across locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Talent Attraction, HR Business Partners, managers and employees to deliver seamless People Operations support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process improvement opportunities and contribute to operational excellence initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain process documentation, work instructions and knowledge resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain efficient, compliant and employee-centric lifecycle processes while delivering excellent employee support and self-service solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
